{"name":"孟菲斯","description":"孟菲斯是一种用鲜明配色、几何图案和不对称构图表达活力的设计风格 · 它常用波点、三角和波浪线打破严肃秩序，适合活动、教育和创意品牌。装饰可以活跃画面，但正文、表单和主要操作仍要保持稳定清楚。","quote":"那种五颜六色的几何图形、波浪线、波点，很 80 年代。","agentPrompt":"","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-style-memphis\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>孟菲斯<span>Memphis</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">那种五颜六色的几何图形、波浪线、波点，很 80 年代。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">孟菲斯是一种用鲜明配色、几何图案和不对称构图表达活力的设计风格</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>它常用波点、三角和波浪线打破严肃秩序，适合活动、教育和创意品牌。装饰可以活跃画面，但正文、表单和主要操作仍要保持稳定清楚。</span></div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"dh-demo style-detail-demo\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"风格示例，可横向滚动\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"style-detail-canvas\"><div class=\"style-memphis-demo style-memphis-booking\"><i class=\"style-memphis-dots\" style=\"top:14px;left:16px\"></i><i class=\"style-memphis-tri\" style=\"bottom:20px;left:12%\"></i><i class=\"style-memphis-squiggle\" style=\"top:22px;right:7%\"></i><i class=\"style-memphis-ring\" style=\"bottom:16px;right:8%\"></i><div class=\"mp-head\"><b>CLAY<br>CLUB!</b><span>WORKSHOPS · CALENDAR</span><i>04 spots left</i></div><div class=\"mp-book-main\"><section><small>SAT / 15:00 — 17:30</small><h2>捏一个<br>歪歪的杯子<span>!</span></h2><p>两小时陶泥体验，带走一只不完美但只属于你的杯。</p><b class=\"style-memphis-btn\">预约这个时段 →</b><div class=\"mp-details\"><span>材料 / 陶泥 · 釉料</span><span>讲师 / MIKA</span><span>取件 / 14 天后</span></div></section><aside><b>JULY 26</b><span>BEGINNER CLAY</span><strong>¥ 168</strong><em>08 / 12</em></aside></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"principles-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">设计原则 · Principles</div><div class=\"usage-box use principles-box\"><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选择少量几何图案反复使用，形成统一装饰语言</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">活跃配色仍要区分主色、强调色和状态色</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用描边或色块对比让装饰从背景中分离</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把装饰放在留白和独立图层，避免挡住操作</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">保留足够空白，让不对称构图仍然可以阅读</div></li></ul></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">运营和促销活动，需要活跃节奏与识别度</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">品牌活动主视觉：撞色横幅 + 波点 + 之字线</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">运营活动页可使用孟菲斯的节奏感</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">儿童与教育产品，并经过真实用户验证</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><i class=\"ti ti-user style-ti\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> 儿童英语应用：每节课使用一个几何角色</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">活泼的秩序感可支持课程内容与引导</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">创意机构和招聘页，把页面作为作品展示</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">设计工作室招聘页:撞色块 + 散布小三角</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">可表达创作方向，同时让职位与投递方式清楚</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">空状态和插图区域，用小面积图形增加节奏</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">空状态：波点圆、波浪线与「还没有内容」</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">小面积装饰可为状态说明提供情绪支持</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">高频后台系统整页持续使用撞色装饰</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">后台系统多个页面持续使用撞色与散布装饰</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--red);margin-top:4px\">高频工具会因此降低扫描效率并增加视觉疲劳</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">波点和图形覆盖正文与操作区域</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><span style=\"position:absolute;top:6px;left:30%;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd23f;border:2px solid #111\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">装饰覆盖正文会降低可读性</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">柔和配色仍机械搭配强黑边，语言不一致</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;background:#d8c8b8;border-radius:50%\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;background:#b8c4c8;border-radius:50%\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;background:#c8b8c4;border-radius:50%\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">低饱和配色也可使用，但需与几何语言和内容语气协调</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">年报和合同的关键信息被装饰抢走</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">年报数据页、合同签署页使用撞色与散布装饰</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">高风险或正式流程应优先保证信息与操作清楚</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">发展历程 · History</div><div class=\"history-rail\"><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">1981</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>Memphis Group 在米兰成立</b><p>Ettore Sottsass 与设计师伙伴在米兰组建 Memphis Group；名称取自鲍勃·迪伦歌曲《Stuck Inside of Mobile with the Memphis Blues Again》。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">1981—1987</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>以强烈形式语言形成辨识度</b><p>塑料贴面、明亮配色和几何图案成为小组的常见表达，并与当时主流现代主义设计形成对照。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">1987</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>小组解散，视觉语言继续传播</b><p>Memphis Group 在 1987 年解散；其色彩与几何语言随后出现在音乐电视、零售空间与流行文化视觉中。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2010s</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>数字视觉中的再应用</b><p>活动页面、插画和品牌传播中再次出现孟菲斯式几何与配色，并与当代界面结构结合。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">今天</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>用于表达活力与节奏</b><p>活动、儿童产品和创意品牌等页面可借助波点、波浪线和不对称构图强化气氛，同时保持信息清楚。</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"style-memphis-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"geo\"><span class=\"style-memphis-sw\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><i style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd23f;border:2px solid #111;background-image:radial-gradient(#111 1.2px,transparent 1.4px);background-size:6px 6px\"></i><i style=\"width:0;height:0;border-left:8px solid transparent;border-right:8px solid transparent;border-bottom:14px solid #3d5af1\"></i><i style=\"width:20px;height:9px;background:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27; width=&#x27;20&#x27; height=&#x27;9&#x27;&gt;&lt;path d=&#x27;M2 5 Q 5 1, 8 5 T 14 5 T 20 5&#x27; fill=&#x27;none&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%23ee4266&#x27; stroke-width=&#x27;3&#x27;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&quot;) center/contain no-repeat\"></i></span></span></span><span class=\"style-memphis-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"clash\"><span class=\"style-memphis-sw\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:3px\"><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#ffd23f;border:2px solid #111\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#3d5af1;border:2px solid #111\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#ee4266;border:2px solid #111\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#22c1a3;border:2px solid #111\"></i></span></span></span><span class=\"style-memphis-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"stroke\"><span class=\"style-memphis-sw\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#ee4266;border:3px solid #111\"></span></span></span><span class=\"style-memphis-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"scatter\"><span class=\"style-memphis-sw\" style=\"position:relative\"><i style=\"position:absolute;top:5px;left:7px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd23f;border:2px solid #111\"></i><i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;right:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111;font-style:normal\">+</i><i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:14px;width:0;height:0;border-left:6px solid transparent;border-right:6px solid transparent;border-bottom:10px solid #3d5af1\"></i></span></span><span class=\"style-memphis-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"white\"><span class=\"style-memphis-sw\" style=\"background:#fff8ef\"></span></span>\n    </span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"geo\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">几何图案</span><span class=\"pe\">Geometry</span></button><span class=\"pd\">选择少量形状反复变化，建立统一的装饰语言</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"clash\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">撞色</span><span class=\"pe\">Color Clash</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用有主次的对比色制造活力，并检查文字和状态的可辨认度</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"stroke\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">描边</span><span class=\"pe\">Outline</span></button><span class=\"pd\">深色描边可帮助小元素从背景中分离，颜色和粗细按主题调整</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"scatter\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">散布构图</span><span class=\"pe\">Scatter</span></button><span class=\"pd\">将小元素安排在边缘与留白处，保留正文和操作所需的空间</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"white\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">留白</span><span class=\"pe\">Breathing Room</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用空白分开内容和装饰，让高对比元素有明确的阅读位置</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"prompt-section prompt-section-dialogue\"><div class=\"section-title\">AI 提示词 · Prompt</div><div class=\"prompt-box prompt-box-dialogue\"><blockquote><p>做一个陶艺工作坊预约页。用活泼的几何装饰和有主次的色彩表达活动气氛，同时让日期、时段、名额、价格和预约按钮容易找到。预约信息只用我提供的资料，缺少的先标“待补充”，不要自行生成。</p></blockquote><button type=\"button\" class=\"prompt-copy\" aria-label=\"复制\" title=\"复制\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">创意工作坊预约</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"创意工作坊预约\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"style-memphis-scene\"><div class=\"mp-scene-top\"><b>CLAY CLUB!</b><span>WEEKEND WORKSHOPS</span><i>MENU +</i></div><div class=\"mp-scene-main\"><section><small>SAT · JULY 26 · 15:00</small><h3>捏一个<br>歪歪的杯子!</h3><p>初学者陶泥体验 · 2.5 小时</p><button>预约这个时段 →</button></section><aside><b>08</b><span>SPOTS LEFT</span><strong>¥ 168</strong><i>◒</i></aside></div><div class=\"mp-scene-foot\"><span>包含烧制 · 茶点 · 工具</span><b>适合第一次玩泥巴的人</b></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">大促活动页</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"大促活动页\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:3px solid #111;background:#fff8ef;position:relative\">\n      <i style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;left:18px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd23f;border:3px solid #111;background-image:radial-gradient(#111 1.4px,transparent 1.6px);background-size:9px 9px\"></i>\n      <i style=\"position:absolute;top:20px;right:24px;width:0;height:0;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-bottom:22px solid #3d5af1\"></i>\n      <i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:70px;left:30px;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#111;font-style:normal\">+</i>\n      <i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:88px;right:36px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;border:5px solid #22c1a3\"></i>\n      <div style=\"padding:20px 24px 0;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:18px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#111\">\n        <span>主会场</span><span style=\"color:#999\">榜单</span><span style=\"color:#999\">优惠券</span><span style=\"color:#999\">我的</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;padding:14px 24px 20px;position:relative\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#111;letter-spacing:1px\">618 撞色狂欢节</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#555;margin:8px 0 12px\">全场 5 折起 · 每满 300 减 50</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px\">\n          <sp